-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-647e1748-8456-4d2e-85a2-62aed78e22ad\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f80b2be9-7f54-497f-852d-e1ac8232c435\"><b>✔️ 일시</b></span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9d3b2c62-a716-4d3d-8bf2-6f2b85e69e3e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-90237af1-ab51-4f94-bd8d-19e4a0ab1032\">- 9/23(수) 11:00 ~ 14:00 경</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-616860af-4ee7-4749-a047-4ec7e72f10bd\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e9d7b2fa-1e8f-466a-8d15-458590d504be\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a458dfba-8294-408b-978f-6a5d6d0c00b0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-14a1d4fa-276c-4aa7-98d5-5ec18267cedc\"><b>✔️ 내용</b></span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3e7bd930-d2b6-4dba-b2db-d7b41b926bf8\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-65b35513-3a1d-4a03-93bc-8cbba34fb29b\">1. 특정 칭호가 흑백으로 보이는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a35dc871-ae63-4f7a-9d07-ac42bc9810ca\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-29e21bb1-7798-46cf-a5a8-6da8c7e1e837\">[대상]</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-be95addf-a17d-4eec-9a49-95a3e67dc119\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9c36d867-4e32-4d29-ada6-d55bc8255df2\">└ 클리어 마스터</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-442479e4-c528-4b7e-a29f-3adcc5c0168c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6b5dc0fa-a215-40bb-b8a2-de9cd94cfd9b\">└ 풀 콤보 마스터</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4ac9fbd7-0d5e-4401-bf39-be629e2df135\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a44aca8d-28b4-4eff-864b-58352aae266a\">└ 올 퍼펙트 마스터</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9bb66681-3fe8-4f2c-a01c-770b2a3c28c2\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-dd6ab57e-9ade-4f92-98b8-50e6868cc3e8\">2. 일부 언어 환경에서 미니 게임 THREE COMPANY RUMBLE 타이틀 화면의 남은 시간이 표시되지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4983a7cf-246c-420e-9f27-63cbfa9b6dbb\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-83d6c377-ca5e-488c-a33d-919255b3bb0d\">3. 크러스트 - 트릿 셰프의 터치 모션을 좀 더 자연스럽게 조정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7c838b34-7d39-468e-8b1a-5c5ec64fe493\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d36bf76a-28bc-4754-ad7a-0e7303cde039\">4. 이벤트 필드 COIN RUSH SHOWDOWN의 입장 연출에 일부 이펙트를 추가하였습니다. </span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a86bd4c9-05a2-4cda-8239-5ca38628c9bb\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-1cc97dfd-5b54-4412-9783-b8efcbdb0ba2\">5. 설정 - 그래픽에서 [전투 이펙트]를 [균형] 이하로 설정한 경우, 전투 중 대상 니케의 모드를 나타내는 이펙트가 표시되지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-00bd3189-fb9d-46b0-869b-4f1f511da110\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4f450d2b-79a4-4f8c-bff8-46ebd7562795\">[대상]</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d0f514ef-0dfd-444c-a705-71e8bccea1ea\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9b8482fc-4152-406f-a226-d7a3f5794fb3\">└ 길티 : 마이티 바니</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-448d65e8-b165-430a-b7eb-e8a97e349090\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5246eed1-bffc-400b-a44b-0f4cd3fe5b66\">└ 신 : 스위프트 바니</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bc9ec018-6b6f-4476-938f-5470ddbe0926\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4a20f902-3855-4cc3-a953-09a8331abc5f\">6. 일부 언어의 로컬라이징 이슈를 수정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1f540d5b-ea36-47a9-bdfd-06ddc7300bdb\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-24a66e97-22de-4061-ade8-9788c9792ac3\">7. 특정 PC 환경에서 빈 로비 화면이 표시되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-53080bfd-50a1-4386-b62c-918eecc4e5b9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-36f0ffe0-b9ed-48b5-b7f1-88a525b7f211\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-66d9e23d-a47f-4e15-a1c5-76fe5f4c4d42\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs